back. "I am loaded with glass

39
00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.145
fruit. They are for my

40
00:02:10.146 --> 00:02:12.354
mother." He reached into a

41
00:02:12.355 --> 00:02:14.209
pocket. "Here is a sparkling red

42
00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.529
one. You may have

43
00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.581
it!" "No!" screamed

44
00:02:19.582 --> 00:02:21.631
Magrib. "I don’t want any

45
00:02:21.632 --> 00:02:23.395
jewels! I want only the

46
00:02:23.396 --> 00:02:26.100
lamp! Give it to me now!

47
