obey?" The magician stomped his feet until dust flew up around

55
00:03:00.681 --> 00:03:03.603
him. He pounded his head with his

56
00:03:03.604 --> 00:03:08.153
fists. "Cannot obey me?" he

57
00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:11.940
screamed. He pulled the silver box from his

58
00:03:11.941 --> 00:03:15.229
